# Issue 2: Filebeat and Dashboard Not Installed

## Problem

After the installation completed, I verified the Wazuh services and noticed that only the **Wazuh Manager** and **Wazuh Indexer** were running.

The Dashboard and Filebeat services were missing.

Checking the Dashboard service returned:

```text
Unit wazuh-dashboard.service could not be found.
```

The screenshot below shows that the Manager and Indexer were running successfully while the Dashboard and Filebeat services were not installed.

<img width="1536" height="1152" alt="Missing Dashboard and Filebeat" src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/3d2d6d60-6e88-45a2-9c8c-4559f3e0fd5b" />

---

## Cause

The installation had terminated during the Filebeat installation phase because of the APT lock.

As a result, only part of the Wazuh stack was installed successfully.

---

## Resolution

After resolving the APT lock issue, I reran the Wazuh installer.

The installer completed successfully and installed the remaining components, including:

- Wazuh Dashboard
- Filebeat

Afterwards, all Wazuh services were verified and confirmed to be running.

